/*
 * The prefix dg_ on every external name the vendored lz4 defines (design
 * item 15), which gcc and clang compile its sources with and its headers in
 * include give their users, so no shared library's reference to lz4's own
 * names can bind to the fork's copy. The functions lz4 defines before any
 * declaration of them are macros, since gcc renames a function only from its
 * declaration.
 */

